<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>

    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>Không có quyền truy cập</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/dist/tabler-icons.min.css">
        <style>
            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }

            body {
                font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
                background: #F8FAFC;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                min-height: 100vh;
            }

            .wrap {
                text-align: center;
                padding: 48px 32px;
                background: #fff;
                border-radius: 16px;
                border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
                max-width: 420px;
                width: 100%;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .06);
            }

            .icon-wrap {
                width: 72px;
                height: 72px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: #FCEBEB;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                margin: 0 auto 20px;
                font-size: 32px;
                color: #A32D2D;
            }

            .code {
                font-size: 56px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #E2E8F0;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }

            .title {
                font-size: 20px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #0F172A;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }

            .desc {
                font-size: 14px;
                color: #64748B;
                line-height: 1.6;
                margin-bottom: 28px;
            }

            .btn {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 8px;
                padding: 11px 24px;
                border-radius: 9px;
                background: #1B2A4A;
                color: #fff;
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 600;
                text-decoration: none;
                transition: all .15s;
            }

            .btn:hover {
                background: #0F1E36;
            }

            .role-badge {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
                background: #F1F5F9;
                color: #475569;
                padding: 4px 12px;
                border-radius: 20px;
                font-size: 12px;
                font-weight: 500;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }
        </style>
    </head>

<body>
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="ti ti-lock"></i></div>
        <div class="code">403</div>
        <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined') { %>
        <div class="role-badge">
            <i class="ti ti-user"></i>
            Vai trò của bạn: <strong><%= user.effectiveRole %></strong>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <div class="title">Không có quyền truy cập</div>
        <div class="desc">
            Trang này yêu cầu quyền cao hơn.<br>
            Vui lòng liên hệ quản trị viên nếu bạn cần truy cập.
        </div>
        <a href="/api/tasks/dashboard" class="btn">
            <i class="ti ti-arrow-left"></i> Về trang chủ
        </a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>